        "raw": "From what I can see, everything is done in order, and one step is not taken until the previous step has finished.  In this case, \"Search the trash and play an equipment\" must be completed prior to \"Deal self one cold and one fire damage,\" which would mean that the equipment card is in play before the damage (healing) can occur.",
