      {
        "id": 21202,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-11T21:33:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For reference:</p>\n<p>[quote=““Focused Apertures””]<br>\nIncrease cold damage dealt by Absolute Zero by 1.<br>\n[/quote]</p>\n<p>[quote=““Modular Realignment””]<br>\nSelect 1 Equipment card from your Trash and put it either into your hand or into play. Absolute Zero deals himself 1 fire damage and 1 cold damage.<br>\n[/quote]</p>\n<p>[quote=““Null-Point Calibration Unit””]<br>\nWhen Absolute Zero would take cold damage, regain that many HP instead.<br>\n[/quote]</p>\n<p>So, in the example cited above, the following events would happen in the following order:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The player would remove Null-Point Calibration Unit from their Trash and put it into play.</li>\n<li>Modular Realignment would deal Absolute Zero 1 fire damage.</li>\n<li>Modular Realignment would deal Absolute Zero 1 cold damage, which would actually be 2 cold damage because of Focused Apertures.  Because Modular Realignment is in play, Absolute Zero would regain 2 HP instead of losing 2 HP</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The sequence of events gets even more complex if Isothermic Transducer is in play.  In that case:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The player would remove Null-Point Calibration Unit from their Trash and put it into play.</li>\n<li>Modular Realignment would deal Absolute Zero 1 fire damage.</li>\n<li>Absolute Zero could then deal the target of his choice 1 cold damage, which would actually be 2 cold damage because of Focused Apertures.</li>\n<li>Modular Realignment would deal Absolute Zero 1 cold damage, which would actually be 2 cold damage because of Focused Apertures.  Because Modular Realignment is in play, Absolute Zero would regain 2 HP instead of losing 2 HP</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cryochamber makes this sequence of events <em>even more</em> thrilling… and that’s why I love Absolute Zero <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:18.441Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 5051,
        "topic_slug": "stacking-of-effects",
        "display_username": "Paul",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "Judges",
        "flair_url": "scale-balanced",
        "flair_bg_color": "7700ff",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 42,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
